{
  "source": "Prompts/layers-1.mp4",
  "duration": 165.2331875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.02,
      "end": 4.96,
      "text": "Have you ever read a sentence in a book that made absolutely no sense until you read it"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.96,
      "end": 6.3,
      "text": "a second or third time?"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.3,
      "end": 9.82,
      "text": "Artificial intelligence actually does something very similar."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.4,
      "end": 15.18,
      "text": "To figure out what a prompt means, AI passes your text through a sequential system of"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.18,
      "end": 16.16,
      "text": "mathematical layers."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.92,
      "end": 19.08,
      "text": "Look at this diagram of a confusing sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.66,
      "end": 21.48,
      "text": "The horse raced past the barn fell."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.16,
      "end": 24.02,
      "text": "At first, the grammar seems broken."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.58,
      "end": 25.94,
      "text": "You try different interpretations."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.68,
      "end": 27.46,
      "text": "Did a barn fall?"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.46,
      "end": 29.56,
      "text": "Did the horse race past afterward?"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.3,
      "end": 34.16,
      "text": "Finally, you realize someone raced a horse past a barn, and then it fell."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.96,
      "end": 38.08,
      "text": "Your comprehension of the sentence relies on each repeated pass."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.74,
      "end": 42.66,
      "text": "With every read, you update the meaning of the words until the whole thought makes sense."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.42,
      "end": 45.04,
      "text": "AI doesn't read the way we do."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.48,
      "end": 49.38,
      "text": "Instead, it processes your text through a mathematical stack called a neural network."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.86,
      "end": 52.16,
      "text": "This shows how neural network layers are structured."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.76,
      "end": 57.9,
      "text": "Inside each, attention and transformation update your words' numerical representations,"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.46,
      "end": 60.56,
      "text": "passing them sequentially to the next layer."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.24,
      "end": 63.58,
      "text": "The bottom table shows a word's initial state."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.22,
      "end": 68.76,
      "text": "As these values move through the layers to the end, the numbers shift at every stage."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.46,
      "end": 74.26,
      "text": "These shifting decimal values are the machine's version of a human rereading a sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.98,
      "end": 77.7,
      "text": "The changing math represents a sharpening of meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.22,
      "end": 84.72,
      "text": "We can see exactly how this mathematical meaning resolves by tracing one specific word through the system."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.68,
      "end": 86.12,
      "text": "Test sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.94,
      "end": 90.74,
      "text": "The cat sat on the mat during the May rainstorm because it was tired."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.52,
      "end": 93.6,
      "text": "The AI starts with zero context."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.36,
      "end": 95.74,
      "text": "Raw numbers provide no clue."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.42,
      "end": 100.3,
      "text": "Through layers one and two, numbers adjust to embed the connection."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.04,
      "end": 104.94,
      "text": "Finally, the results mathematically conclude it refers to cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.52,
      "end": 110.56,
      "text": "This step-by-step mathematical journey is how AI builds contextual connections"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.56,
      "end": 112.38,
      "text": "that human readers make instantly."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.24,
      "end": 115.08,
      "text": "This naturally raises a question."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.88,
      "end": 120.02,
      "text": "Exactly how many layers are required in a real-world AI model?"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.68,
      "end": 123.12,
      "text": "Tech companies rarely share their exact designs,"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.38,
      "end": 128.92,
      "text": "but published models often use dozens and sometimes well over a hundred distinct layers."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.39,
      "end": 133.22,
      "text": "If it takes multiple layers just to link a pronoun to a noun,"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.78,
      "end": 136.72,
      "text": "more nuanced language needs even more room to work."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.46,
      "end": 142.56,
      "text": "AI uses these dozens of extra steps to untangle the relationships behind sarcasm,"
    },
    {
      "start": 143.02,
      "end": 145.1,
      "text": "story twists, and complicated reasoning."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.78,
      "end": 149.18,
      "text": "Every additional layer demands more computing power and time."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.16,
      "end": 154.2,
      "text": "Developers have to balance the intelligence of their model against the cost of running it."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.74,
      "end": 157.82,
      "text": "Ultimately, meaning builds up, layer by layer,"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.82,
      "end": 161.72,
      "text": "with attention and transformation, dozens of times."
    }
  ],
